  "details": "Steps to reproduce:\n\n1. Login to https://ask.vrchat.com/, the \"Categories\" button will be blue without visible text.\n\n2. Go to https://ask.vrchat.com/latest?order=created, the \"Latest\" button will be blue without visible text.\n\nhttps://ask.vrchat.com/t/forum-air-theme-highlight-button-bug/49037\n\nThe temporary fix (expected result) in developer tools is to disable/remove the topmost CSS block in `common.scss`:\n\n```\n\n.nav-pills>li a.active {\n\n    background-color: var(--tertiary) !important;\n\n    }\n\n    \n\n    \n\n```",
